WEBVTT

00:00:00.152 --> 00:00:03.309
Here is a real game. To start one, press Create Game.

00:00:03.771 --> 00:00:07.611
Choose how many people are playing, and how many computer critters join you.

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:12.017
Generate the current, and you are in the waiting room. Press Start Game.

00:00:12.753 --> 00:00:19.238
When the banner turns gold, it is your turn. You do one thing: draw two cards, play a card, or move an animal.

00:00:19.719 --> 00:00:24.242
Drawing is easy. Take two from the draw pile, two from the Pool, or one of each.

00:00:24.771 --> 00:00:29.550
Every card is two animals, one on each side. Hover over a card to see both.

00:00:30.022 --> 00:00:33.542
Oceans come first. Drag one from your hand onto your board.

00:00:34.019 --> 00:00:39.694
Pay its cost with other cards from your hand. Match the symbol in the corner, and its star switches on.

00:00:40.169 --> 00:00:44.308
The card you paid with lands in the Pool, face up, where anyone can draw it.

00:00:44.786 --> 00:00:48.818
The mangrove's star is play again, so a free animal goes straight onto it.

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:53.093
Your score sits under your name. Click any player to look at their board.

00:00:55.701 --> 00:00:59.712
Stuck? Strategy suggests a plan, and lights up the cards that build it.

00:01:00.204 --> 00:01:04.428
Keep building until someone draws the end game card. Highest score wins.
